  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.2.0-rc.1: the renderer a Minecraft-style game needs - BlockRenderPipeline, ColumnMesher (a whole column meshed on the GPU), HeightmapMesher (far tier), the section index inside the quad (one draw per column), BindPass skipping repeats; see CHANGELOG.md. Earlier (0.2.0-local.1): BlockRenderPipeline (textured/tinted/lit/fogged blocks from PackedQuad buffers; opaque, plant and water passes; texture array with repeat so merged quads tile), BlockTextureArray.FromAtlas (GPU-side atlas slicing), BlockMaterial; deps SpawnDev.ILGPU 5.3.7, SpawnJS.Blazor 3.0.4. Earlier: Dig remesh: reuse padded staging + GPU block upload buffer; MeshChunkColumn Y-range/section-list overloads; BlockColumnCarveService + FillKernel; ExplosionKernels byte-column helpers.",
